    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the battlefield in Void Guard Outpost, an amazing tower defense game where you get to alter the enemy's path! You can build epic mazes, place mighty towers, and adapt your strategy to outsmart relentless waves of foes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make shapes the challenge\u2014will your defenses hold?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574090/extras/30caf5af28cbc05485eebef832579c6b.avif?t=1742846766\" width=800 height=226 /></span>You can play each map in generic endless mode to gather resources to buy new towers, upgrades and abilities to improve your play style for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574090/extras/28490c892b052932448f2a2d753ea30c.avif?t=1742846766\" width=800 height=226 /></span>At the moment, there are over 40 towers and upgrades that you can unlock and use however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574090/extras/3d995d881ae4923219c2f688229c6caa.avif?t=1742846766\" width=800 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, there are over 10 different active and passive abilities that you can use to help your towers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Maze</strong> \u2013 Change the enemy's path and control their movement. <strong></strong><br><strong>Strategic Tower Placement</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of towers, each with unique features.<br>\u00a0<strong>Face Different Enemies</strong> \u2013 Each enemy type has unique abilities designed to challenge your defenses.<br><strong>Upgrades for Towers and Abilities</strong> \u2013 Enhance your towers and abilities to become stronger with every try.<br><strong>Endless Mode for Every Level</strong> \u2013 Test your defenses and see how long you can survive against infinite waves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you build the perfect maze and withstand the onslaught? Defend your base, adapt your strategy, and push your limits in Void Guard Outpost!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574090/extras/30114e3d5b2a1fb3f5a0817876855a99.avif?t=1742846766\" data-has-big width=800 height=566 /></span></p>",
