hallenge your defenses.<br><strong>Upgrades for Towers and Abilities</strong> \u2013 Enhance your towers and abilities to become stronger with every try.<br><strong>Endless Mode for Every Level</strong> \u2013 Test your defenses and see how long you can survive against infinite waves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you build the perfect maze and withstand the onslaught? Defend your base, adapt your strategy, and push your limits in Void Guard Outpost!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574090/extras/30114e3d5b2a1fb3f5a0817876855a99.avif?t=1742846766\" data-has-big width=800 height=566 /></span></p>",
